        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Bacterian!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden deep inside, our immune system is locked in a constant fight against germs and pathogens, ensuring we stay strong and healthy. Bacterian lets you experience this struggle firsthand in an exciting action-puzzle take on the classic Sokoban-like gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570450/extras/82ec0e568532306310c4fc0a0d37fb8b.avif?t=1758183876\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570450/extras/7a83612ede18465c595f6def4c9530a6.poster.avif?t=1758183876\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570450/extras/7a83612ede18465c595f6def4c9530a6.webm?t=1758183876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570450/extras/7a83612ede18465c595f6def4c9530a6.mp4?t=1758183876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to stay alive, you have to keep moving. Always! Be quick with your tactics and outsmart the hostile pathogens. Put blocks in their way to change their paths, use teleports or trap them in closed areas - all this to finish them off before they catch and infect you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570450/extras/d623b1633dfc4f154bfeb80b36b164b5.avif?t=1758183876\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570450/extras/31023d88ccadaafc3486b10ad74d615c.poster.avif?t=1758183876\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570450/extras/31023d88ccadaafc3486b10ad74d615c.webm?t=1758183876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570450/extras/31023d88ccadaafc3486b10ad74d615c.mp4?t=1758183876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a fearless Immune Cell, you can fight back! Squash the pesky invaders by sliding blocks onto them and make sure to get rid of them all. Be careful though - germs vary in looks, intelligence, abilities and speed, so every encounter requires quite a different approach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570450/extras/7f275a5f98ec65129121424a0c6736ba.avif?t=1758183876\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570450/extras/c5b1888984b8c790749f3f699491b7ed.poster.avif?t=1758183876\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570450/extras/c5b1888984b8c790749f3f699491b7ed.webm?t=1758183876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570450/extras/c5b1888984b8c790749f3f699491b7ed.mp4?t=1758183876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore diverse levels set throughout every corner of your body... and beyond! Defend not only yourself, but also your animal friends. Remember - the further you go, the more advanced mechanics and solutions you'll face. Can you overcome troublesome diseases once and for all and keep everyone safe?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570450/extras/d67f688be295bcf12ca57f7a0c58b2f6.avif?t=1758183876\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• The fan favorite, evergreen Sokoban-like gameplay </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Clear pixel art graphics allowing you to fully focus on action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Music and sound effects that spark a wave of 8bit nostalgia</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Numerous varied levels with level editor, enemies and mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Easy to play / hard to master approach, allowing you to utilize many different strategies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Take care, stay healthy and play Bacterian!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570450/extras/c3dc2389d40001f393a344014de0d5d7.avif?t=1758183876\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570450/extras_big/c3dc2389d40001f393a344014de0d5d7.avif?t=1758183876 width=800 height=200 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Bacterian!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden deep inside, our immune system is locked in a constant fight against germs and pathogens, ensuring we stay strong and healthy. Bacterian lets you experience this struggle firsthand in an exciting action-puzzle take on the classic Sokoban-like gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570450/extras/82ec0e568532306310c4fc0a0d37fb8b.avif?t=1758183876\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570450/extras/7a83612ede18465c595f6def4c9530a6.poster.avif?t=1758183876\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570450/extras/7a83612ede18465c595f6def4c9530a6.webm?t=1758183876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570450/extras/7a83612ede18465c595f6def4c9530a6.mp4?t=1758183876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to stay alive, you have to keep moving. Always! Be quick with your tactics and outsmart the hostile pathogens. Put blocks in their way to change their paths, use teleports or trap them in closed areas - all this to finish them off before they catch and infect you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570450/extras/d623b1633dfc4f154bfeb80b36b164b5.avif?t=1758183876\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570450/extras/31023d88ccadaafc3486b10ad74d615c.poster.avif?t=1758183876\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570450/extras/31023d88ccadaafc3486b10ad74d615c.webm?t=1758183876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570450/extras/31023d88ccadaafc3486b10ad74d615c.mp4?t=1758183876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a fearless Immune Cell, you can fight back! Squash the pesky invaders by sliding blocks onto them and make sure to get rid of them all. Be careful though - germs vary in looks, intelligence, abilities and speed, so every encounter requires quite a different approach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570450/extras/7f275a5f98ec65129121424a0c6736ba.avif?t=1758183876\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570450/extras/c5b1888984b8c790749f3f699491b7ed.poster.avif?t=1758183876\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570450/extras/c5b1888984b8c790749f3f699491b7ed.webm?t=1758183876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570450/extras/c5b1888984b8c790749f3f699491b7ed.mp4?t=1758183876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore diverse levels set throughout every corner of your body... and beyond! Defend not only yourself, but also your animal friends. Remember - the further you go, the more advanced mechanics and solutions you'll face. Can you overcome troublesome diseases once and for all and keep everyone safe?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570450/extras/d67f688be295bcf12ca57f7a0c58b2f6.avif?t=1758183876\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• The fan favorite, evergreen Sokoban-like gameplay </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Clear pixel art graphics allowing you to fully focus on action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Music and sound effects that spark a wave of 8bit nostalgia</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Numerous varied levels with level editor, enemies and mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Easy to play / hard to master approach, allowing you to utilize many different strategies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Take care, stay healthy and play Bacterian!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570450/extras/c3dc2389d40001f393a344014de0d5d7.avif?t=1758183876\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570450/extras_big/c3dc2389d40001f393a344014de0d5d7.avif?t=1758183876 width=800 height=200 /></span></p>",
        "short_description": "Fight off filthy diseases and germs in Bacterian, a fresh twist on the Sokoban style game. Take on the role of a brave immune cell and squash varied pathogenic hostiles - from head to toe, beat the next levels and keep your body fit and healthy! Be clever, smart and quick - invaders won't stay idle.",
